@startuml RF41_Classes
title RF41 — Ganhar FAI Points em todos os jogos (FLAIR e Desafios) e ao criar esquemas e peças\nDiagrama de classes — entidades JPA reais (fai-domain) e enums
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E4DEF0
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty methods

package "fai-domain · model" {
class FaiPointsLedgerEntry <<@Table fai_points_ledger>> {
  +id: UUID
  +userId: UUID
  +delta: int
  +actionCode: String
  +refType: String
  +refId: String
  +idempotencyKey: String
  +countsLifetime: boolean
  +createdAt: Instant
}
class FaiPointsRule <<@Table fai_points_rules>> {
  +actionCode: String  <<@Id>>
  +points: int
  +dailyCap: Integer
  +weeklyCap: Integer
  +oncePerRef: boolean
  +active: boolean
  +description: String
}
class UserAchievement <<@Table user_achievements>> {
  +userId: UUID
  +achievementCode: String
  +secret: boolean
  +grantedAt: Instant
}
class RoomLayout <<@Table room_layouts>> {
  +level: String = "ESTREIA"
}
}
package "fai-application · service" {
class FaiPointsService {
  +game(userId, game, matchRef, outcome): int
  +award(userId, actionCode, refType, refId, pointsOverride): Award
  +awardIsolated(...): Award
  +balance(userId): long
  +lifetime(userId): long
  +level(userId): Level
  +account(user): Map
}
enum "FaiPointsService.Level" as Level {
  ESTREIA (0)
  STUDIO (300)
  LOFT (900)
  CLOSET (2000)
  ATELIER (4000)
  PENTHOUSE (7500)
  MAISON (12000)
}
class "FaiPointsService.Award" as Award <<record>> {
  +granted: boolean
  +points: int
  +capReached: boolean
  +level: Level
  +levelUp: boolean
}
class FlairService {
  +duel(user, schemeId, opponent): Map
  +joinArena(user, schemeId): Map
  +teamBattle(user, opponentCode): Map
  +claimQuest(user, code): Map
}
class ChallengeService {
  +submitEntry(user, id, schemeId): Map
}
class WardrobeEventListeners {
  +onSchemeSaved(SchemeSaved)
  +onPieceCreated(PieceCreated)
  +onPieceUpdated(PieceUpdated)
  +onModel3d(Model3dGenerated)
}
class AchievementService {
  +grant(userId, code): boolean
  +list(user): List
}
}
FaiPointsLedgerEntry "*" ..> "1" FaiPointsRule : actionCode
FaiPointsService --> FaiPointsLedgerEntry : grava (append-only)
FaiPointsService --> FaiPointsRule : lê
FaiPointsService --> Award
FaiPointsService --> Level
FaiPointsService ..> RoomLayout : setLevel (RoomLayoutAccess)
FlairService --> FaiPointsService
ChallengeService --> FaiPointsService
WardrobeEventListeners --> FaiPointsService
AchievementService --> FaiPointsService
AchievementService --> UserAchievement
note bottom of FaiPointsRule : V26: GAME_PLAYED 5 (6/dia), GAME_WON 10 (4/dia),\nFLAIR_QUEST 10 (3/dia); SCHEME_CREATED 40 (5/dia),\nPIECE_CATALOGED 25 (10/dia), PIECE_COMPLETED 10, PIECE_3D 15
note right of FaiPointsLedgerEntry : idempotencyKey = usuário:ação:ref\n(ref jogo:partida paga 1×)
@enduml
